OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after Irish politician
OL,4,Aassaulted in Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after an Irish
OL,7,Fpolitician was assaulted in Dublin on
OL,8,FWednesday.
OL,10,FThe man, who is in his 50s, will appear
OL,11,Fin court in Dublin on Friday morning.
OL,13,FIndependent TD Michael Healy-Rae was
OL,14,Fattacked after 16:00 local time.
OL,16,FHe had stopped at traffic lights on
OL,17,FCork Street when a passer-by walked
OL,18,Fover to the open car window and punched
OL,19,Fhim in the face.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
